SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Shafi Hossain
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 3070 Windward Plaza\, Alpharetta
DESCRIPTION:Shafi Hossain is a New York City-based stand-up comedian\, writ
 er\, and producer. Originally from Bangladesh\, he moved to the United Stat
 es to study chemical engineering before falling in love with standup comedy
 . Now a regular performer at the prestigious Comedy Cellar\, Shafi has esta
 blished himself as a prominent voice in the NYC comedy scene. He was named 
 one of "New York's Funniest Stand Ups" by the New York Comedy Festival and 
 has been featured on Kevin Hart’s LOL Network series Road Comics on Peaco
 ck. Shafi has toured internationally—headlining shows in London\, Paris\,
  Bangladesh\, and Canada.\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the 
 Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drink items from the men
 u.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not c
 ount towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prev
 ent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or danger
 ous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/even
 t/in-the-other-room-shafi-hossain/
